repository-code: "https://github.com/youweizhong/PANDA"
url: "https://github.com/youweizhong/PANDA"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  PANDA is the official implementation of Certified but Private: Scalable
  Zero-Knowledge Proofs for Neural Network Guarantees. It uses zero-knowledge
  proofs to certify neural-network robustness and fairness properties while
  keeping model parameters private, building on CROWN-style certification.
keywords:
  - zero-knowledge proofs
  - neural network verification
  - robustness certification
  - fairness
  - privacy
